Bandicoot is written by a team of developers, whose attribution notices are
reproduced verbatim from upstream in the NOTICE file installed alongside this
one:

  Copyright 2017-2026 Ryan Curtin (https://ratml.org)
  Copyright 2017-2026 Marcus Edel (https://kurg.org)
