Per-file copyright and license details -- including the MAGMA and clMAGMA code
in the OpenCL backend, which carries a 3-clause BSD license from the University
of Tennessee in addition to the Apache License -- are in the COPYRIGHTS file.

The RcppBandicoot package provides an integration of Bandicoot and its dependencies
into R. RcppBandicoot accomplishes this by linking into Rcpp,
establishing plugins, examples, and more. The R implementation was done by James
Joseph Balamuta with additional contributions by contributors listed in NEWS.md
and in the repository history at https://github.com/coatless-rpkg/rcppbandicoot.
